WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.330
Won’t leave

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.080
without a dropkick on her!

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.250
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
-I can’t go back to Hell!
-Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.280
If you go too far,

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:46.280
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.540
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.660
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.880
-To attack her from behind!
-You’re so mean.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.130
I’ll never give up.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.760
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can’t leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.360
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.570
But until then,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
-let’s all have fun together!
-Yeah!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.460
Once a post-World War II
black market,

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:42.920
it has since evolved into an electronics
then computer district,

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:47.090
and now flourishes today
as the mecca of otaku.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:49.510
This is Akihabara.

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.770
You'll find more than
400 Gachapon machines here.

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:53.770
GACHAPON HALL

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.480
You won't be able to resist
the urge to play!

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.730
If this comes out next, I'll die.

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:10.280
My life's spared. But a skyfish? Lame!

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:16.290
But, boy, I can't get enough
of that adrenaline rush putting my life on the line!

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:18.790
It's not like I'm really gonna die anyway.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.880
I don't need any more of you.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:26.930
What in the--?

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:31.720
You bastard! Can't you see
this devil lying in the street?

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.890
You might as well drive into a pole and die!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:38.520
Hello, everyone, please do not
lie down in the street

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.520
and shout obscenities in public.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:43.230
Damn it, another double!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.110
Burn in Hell!

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:51.490
I just need that rare Tsuchinoko
and my collection's complete.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.960
Nope. Not interested in the actual, physical one.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.590
We can't have pets in Yurine's apartment.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.090
Beth being an exception, of course.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.760
Let's try this again.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.720
I only have enough to buy dinner.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:18.980
But, let's live it up...

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.900
Don't you dare waste that money.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.400
If you do, I'll throw you in the wood chipper.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.990
Throw you in the woodchipper...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.530
Woodchipper...?

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.580
Woodchippers grind wood
into smaller woodchips.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:40.290
One mistake using it, and you're on your way to hell!

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.630
Speak of the devil...

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:49.340
If I spend this money, I'm dead.
I give up.

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.090
Excuse me...

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.100
-I wanna do that one.
-Go ahead.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.310
"I wanna do that one."

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.980
"Let's do it."

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.350
It's a Tsuchinoko!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.110
What?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.480
-Damn it!
-That completes my collection!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.570
I tried so many times
to get that Tsuchinoko!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.570
And this kid gets it
on his first try?

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.950
I want it so bad!

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.120
That Tsuchinoko looks glorious!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.710
I'll kill him.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.380
Without so much as a pang of guilt,
I'll make that Tsuchinoko mine!

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:26.920
Wait a minute.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:30.760
There's gotta be a smarter way
to get it from him.

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:36.350
For I am an advanced,
high-level schemer of a devil.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:40.930
Wow, that's amazing.
You got the rare Tsuchinoko.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.980
Can I get a closer look?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.020
Sure, here you go.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.780
Here you go.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.780
What the hell was that for?

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.160
Damn snake!

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.000
You're disgusting!

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.590
You're the worst.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.050
I don't even want it back, you idiot.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:19.810
Thanks for the heartfelt compliment, little boy.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:21.640
Success!

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:24.810
Got my Tsuchinoko! All right!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.270
Time to shop and head home.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.440
MEAT PAVILION YUKIO

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.410
That was a steal for such good meat.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:40.700
I even got my Tsuchinoko,
I'm on a roll today.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.460
You're the worst!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.580
Now that I think about it...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.260
was it really worth stealing?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.220
Every time I see this,

00:05:55.380 --> 00:06:01.100
the memory of the boy beating me up
will replay in my head.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.730
I'll store it so I don't see it when I get home.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.020
Hey, you!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.270
Yeah, I'm talking to you, snake!

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.290
An unknown number. Hello?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.460
-Is this Yurine Hanazono?
-Yes.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:29.290
-This is Banzaibashi Police.
-Police?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.840
-Hey!
-Yurine!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.670
I got arrested by the police!

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.940
They really locked me up.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.610
Don't you dare act

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:55.650
like you can get away with this!

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.200
The second uppercut of the day. Rough.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.540
No chance for me to explain?
You'd be a bad parent!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.580
I don't intend to be a parent.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:16.420
Are you Yurine Hanazono, her guardian?

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.090
Sure, I guess.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.550
Anyway, who are you?

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:23.810
Who am I?

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:28.060
I'm the Banzaibashi super cop
who keeps the peace in Akiba!

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:33.150
Mei Tachibana!

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.780
-Oh, right.
-Who do you think you are?

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:41.780
So tell me, what did Jashin-chan do?

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.280
She committed theft.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.540
You gotta be kidding me.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.910
You got it all wrong! Hear me out!

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.750
I don't even want it back, you idiot!

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.920
-What are you talking about?
-What do you mean?

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.680
She stole...

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:03.680
She stole...

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.600
My heart! My heart!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.810
My heart! My heart!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.820
I found her while on patrol

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:19.780
and she was so beautiful, I fell in love at first sight!

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:23.070
So, I stopped her and arrested her!

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.830
So cute! So beautiful!

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.330
Get away from me!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:33.040
You're just abusing your power!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.040
-You're just too cute!
-Stop!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.050
-Let's get to the real issue here.
-Yes?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.180
-May I have her?
-That's fine with me.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.680
You didn't even hesitate!

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.850
Yes! Aren't you glad, Orochimaru?

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:51.680
She can't be serious about that name...

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.480
You're too cute, Orochimaru.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:57.820
You're killing me.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.190
She's sick! I don't wanna live with her!

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:06.780
Without Jashin-chan,
how am I gonna clean and cook?

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:09.950
-Sorry, I'll take her back.
-No!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.830
Now that's just cruel,
you can't do that!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.580
If I can't have Orochimaru...

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.340
You must die.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.840
No way!

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:25.470
Whoops, I missed.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.890
It scraped my tail!

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:31.470
Sorry I missed, Orochimaru.
At least my blades were sharp.

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:32.810
Does it hurt?

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:38.770
I love seeing you in pain, suffering.
So adorable!

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:45.110
Time for a celebratory selfie before I finish you.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.910
Come on, give me a peace sign.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.830
I can't... Please forgive me...

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.620
Too cute! So Insta-worthy.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:01.670
-So good, I can't stop!
-I'm dying to go home...

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.970
Oh, it's 5. Work's over.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.550
Gotta go home!

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.800
I refuse to work overtime.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.770
That meat you bought at the market?

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.940
It's in the fridge at the station.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.980
Don't forget to take it.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.310
Later!

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:21.820
I'll see you again soon.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:27.660
She thinks you're adorable. What a freak.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:31.200
She was almost as crazy as you, Yurine.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:34.540
You mentioned something
about a boy earlier.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.790
-What was that about?
-What?

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.420
Oh, that was nothing.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.630
I gotta bury that Tsuchinoko
as soon as I get home.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.550
Jinbocho happenings!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:05.740
I meant to go to the train station.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.240
I wasn't paying attention,
so I entered the wrong door.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:10.570
JINBOCHO STATION

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.580
Put your phone away
when you're walking.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.210
Nice howl, Beth.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.500
Let me join you.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:44.900
My mother said the air
in the human world is polluted.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:51.910
Feels good.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.250
What?

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:05.500
-Please die.
-I decline.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.630
I'm doomed!

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:12.970
If I can't just kill her, I thought I'd politely ask!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:15.430
You really thought that was gonna work?

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.520
Damn it...

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.270
I'm gonna take a bath.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.150
Make sure you take one after me.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.770
Got it.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.320
Did you think you were gonna
get lucky just now?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.070
Just wait...

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.370
Check out the Tsuchinoko!

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.080
Hot damn.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.090
I was on my knees, begging her to die.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:52.180
Why can't she just die for me already?

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:54.550
She's so stubborn.

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.720
Well, I knew it wasn't gonna be that easy.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.850
The mountains are so nice.

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:05.440
Why not take a break from the world
and free your body and soul in the mountains?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.320
You call that taking a break?

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:12.240
What's the point in climbing
when you're gonna descend anyway?

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:16.030
Because the mountains are there?
I don't understand it one bit.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:22.540
But wait, in those suspense dramas,
the murder always takes place...

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.080
on a mountain!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.380
I'M GONNA KILL YOU!

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.210
STOP! I'M SORRY I STOLE YOUR WIFE.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.470
TOO LATE!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.880
YOU WILL REPENT IN HELL!

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:38.680
I NEVER WANTED YOUR WIFE!
ALL I WANTED WAS YOU...!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:43.850
I LOVED YOU TOO!

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:51.400
Which means mountains
are a prime location for murders.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.070
If I can lure Yurine up into the mountains...

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:57.530
Killing her would be a piece of cake!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:01.410
That'll be the end of Yurine!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:05.210
Now, let's visualize this further.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:11.500
Check out this view, Yurine.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.430
Wow, what a stunning sight.

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.340
Hey, there!

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:22.390
Hey, there!

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.820
Finally!

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:35.700
I even get to finish her
with my signaturedropkick!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:36.860
EVIL SMILE

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.530
How about this scenario?

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.740
This rope bridge sure sways a lot.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.540
Help me, Jashin-chan.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:53.710
Stop!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:00.050
Yes! Yes!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:04.390
But, wait, how about this scenario?

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.890
It's a bear.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.190
We gotta play dead.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.070
Now.

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.400
Let's do this.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.200
Cross punch!

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:25.490
I could get a bear to collaborate with me.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.420
That's an assured victory for me.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.590
I'm so excited, I'm gonna wet myself.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:36.880
That was a nice bath.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:40.380
Hey, Yurine. Any plans for tomorrow?

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:41.680
Nope.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.890
Then let's go hiking in the mountains.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:46.930
No way.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:51.940
Okay.

00:15:56.820 --> 00:16:01.820
It seems like this anime
mostly take place in Yurine's room.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.780
But it does make sense to be here.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.450
Let's switch it up
and be in my room for a change.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.080
-Thoughts?
-I barely feel the difference.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.340
Okay.

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.210
Then let's give it a more drastic change.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:22.090
-How about that?
-It's over-the-top!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.650
Jashin-chan?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.530
Got it. I'll be right there.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.650
Okay.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.200
Oh, yeah, I'll bring her a gift.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.030
Thank you very much.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.370
BEAN DAIFUKU

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.370
I hope she'll like it.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.460
Oh yeah, can't forget to withdraw the money.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.890
Hello!

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:10.390
Jashin-chan? I'm here.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.400
I even got Fresh Moon for you.

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:20.190
Since it's the end of the month,
I stopped by the bank too.

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:24.160
Jashin-chan?

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.740
Jashin-chan, what's wrong?

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.420
What's... going on...?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.380
Why...?

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.680
Jashin-chan...

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.930
She's dead...

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:58.020
She sounded so happy
when she called me earlier.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.740
Jashin-chan!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.370
Your reaction!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.460
Your face!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.870
I peeked through the closet...

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.750
It was priceless!
You should've seen it!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.590
Ouch, I laughed so hard I fell over.

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:26.470
That's just the skin I shed.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:30.720
Remember? I shed my skin
once every few thousand years.

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.890
And today was the day.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:38.150
So, I thought of this prank and called you.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:41.020
You really thought I died?

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.320
Of course not, right?

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:47.610
Hey, what's wrong?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:54.120
Did you really think that was funny?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:58.290
-What?
-You just crossed the line.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:04.380
You have no idea how devastated I would be
if you were gone.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:07.760
This isn't good...

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.890
Medusa's in passive-aggressive mode!

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.730
Let me explain.

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:20.520
Medusa gets passive-aggressive
when she's mad to the max!

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:25.780
Another phenomenon that happens
once every few thousand years...

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:29.030
Medusa's passive-aggressive mode.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.780
Two rare events aligned with one another.

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:37.580
It's like celebrating Christmas
and New Year's at once.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.130
Please excuse me now.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.540
I won't be back for a while.

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.380
She's pissed.

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.300
I don't care about you anymore!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:52.890
I'm never coming back!

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:55.470
She's not all cutesy like usual.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:20:00.390
Don't leave, Medusa!

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:04.020
You know I suffer from nervous gastritis!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.440
If you leave me like this,

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.570
my tummy will get all messed up,

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:12.200
and I'll worry myself to death!

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.660
I admit, I crossed the line.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.010
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:36.720
I didn't think you would get so upset.

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.560
I'm done. Bye.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.190
Wait!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:46.270
Forgive me, Medusa!
You're killing me!

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:57.740
Medusa...

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.870
Medusa...

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.620
My tummy...

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:09.000
Just kidding. That was payback.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.510
I'll never leave you.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:18.100
Medusa!

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:22.390
You crossed the line!

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:25.270
Go easy on those pranks, okay?

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:28.270
Yeah, of course. I'm sorry!

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.440
I'll never do it again.

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.110
There, there.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:38.490
I'm home.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.370
Welcome back!

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:43.080
Fresh Moon is so tasty!

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:46.290
This creamy texture goes so well with coffee.

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:49.550
It goes well with tea too.
Want some more?

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:55.720
-I'll unwrap it for you.
-Thanks!

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:58.550
Lovey-dovey as usual.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.850
Say, "Ah."

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:04.560
-Yum!
-How is it?

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:06.060
Delicious!

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:08.480
You got some on your face.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:10.070
Get it off for me.

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:34.590
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:39.510
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:44.850
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:49.270
As she starves to death!

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:51.900
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:54.110
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:58.780
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:02.990
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:05.370
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:12.460
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:16.720
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:20.970
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:23.430
When all is said and done

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:28.140
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:32.820
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:35.070
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:38.740
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:44.280
Insanity and screaming
gnaw at peoples' hearts.

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:47.830
As justice runs rampage,
the city is colored with demons' blood.

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.540
The angels are in despair.

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:54.960
Dropkick on My Devil!
We'll dive into your heart in the next episode too!
